@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] replay-mismatch-fails
Replay execution MUST fail when the blob is malformed, overruns the registered
property, or does not reproduce an interesting failure. A replay mismatch MUST
NOT be reported as a passing test.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] worker-handle-ownership
Each concurrent state-machine worker MUST drive its own cloned `TestCase`
handle, and that handle MUST be released after the worker joins. The root
handle MUST remain with the scheduler that advances state-machine groups.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] imperative-failure-epilogue
Properties-enabled NixOS scripts MUST execute their registered Hegel
properties even when the imperative script raises, then preserve and re-raise
the original imperative exception.
